# IMPLICIT DYNAMICS (M10): Newmark trapezoidal rule + nonlinear geometry.
# The /RUN time and /IMPL/DTINI are PHYSICAL (ms) — unlike implicit
# statics, where they are the load factor. Expected listing: ~236
# steps, 2-3 Newton iterations each, energy balance ~0% at termination;
# the tip crosses the vertical at t = T/4 = 170.2 ms (the
# elliptic-integral period — the linear pendulum would say 158.6).
/RUN/IMPLPEND/1
748.8786210640567
/VERS/2026
/IMPL/DYNA/2
0.5  0.25
/IMPL/NONLIN
/IMPL/DTINI
3.1718699246097066
/IMPL/NEWTON
1e-8  25
/PRINT/-100
/END
